    <briefdescription>
<para>Reads ROS2 .msg files from the ament index and produces full message definition strings (with all transitive dependencies) suitable for Foxglove&apos;s &quot;ros2msg&quot; schema encoding. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Output format matches the rosbag2 convention:</para>
<sect1 id="classlive__telemetry_1_1MessageDefinitionProvider_1autotoc_md0">
<title>&lt;top-level .msg content&gt;</title>
<para>MSG: geometry_msgs/msg/Point </para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classlive__telemetry_1_1MessageDefinitionProvider_1autotoc_md1">
<title>&lt;Point .msg content&gt;</title>
<para>MSG: std_msgs/msg/Header &lt;Header .msg content&gt; ... </para>
</sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
